      en: ["Elevation: Average of 750 meters above sea level", "Soil composition: Fertile volcanic basalt rock", "Products: Tomatoes, melons, onions, and citrus fruits", "Climate: Cooler microclimate compared to the coastal region", "Water management: Use of drip irrigation", "Significance: Strategic center for Djiboutian agriculture"],
