      en: ["Geography: One of the largest tectonic depressions in the country", "Users: Habitat and grazing land for the Afar people", "Water sources: Strategic boreholes for dry season supply", "Flora: Dominance of acacias and heat-resistant shrubs", "Agriculture: Occasional grain cultivation in alluvial soils", "Fauna: Presence of gazelles and African ostriches"],
