      en: ["Organization: Part of the CERD research center", "Location: Near the port of Djibouti City", "Focus: Species of the Red Sea and the Gulf of Aden", "Research: Study of coral bleaching and marine temperatures", "Education: School outreach programs on marine ecology", "Exhibits: Live coral systems and endemic reef fish"],
