      en: ["Region: Highlands of the Goda Mountains (1000-1500m)", "Main nectar plants: African juniper and acacia", "Quality: High purity level and specific aroma", "Economy: Alternative income source to forest exploitation", "Seasonality: Main harvest after rainy seasons", "Structure: Support from local beekeeping cooperatives"],
